ng>Q. What is Bihar Police CSBC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of Bihar Police CSBC is https://csbc.bihar.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
